OL,3,GNEWSADrone footage captures men
OL,4,Acatapulting pheasants
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoachers have been filmed catapulting
OL,7,Fpheasants in footage from drones which
OL,8,Fwere operated by police-trained
OL,9,Fvolunteers.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on farmland at
OL,12,FLinkenholt, north Hampshire, on 7
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FOne of the men, from Dibden Purlieu,
OL,16,Fwas later visited by police and ordered
OL,17,Fto complete a victim awareness course,
OL,18,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,19,FConstabulary said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
